Thus answer:

```python
import base64

transformed = "dGVMiHFlblxhZ2Vtb1wkICQxIGViIGEgaHQzMSB0b29yIGZvIC55dGludSBkbmlGIGVodCByZWRuaWFtZXIgc2kKXVwpfWsye15hZ2Vtb1wra15hZ2Vtb1wyLTIofTIxe159MD1re19kb3JwXFtcCm5laHcgZGVkaXZpZCB5YiAuMDAwMQ=="

# Decode base64 to get the transformed string
decoded = base64.b64decode(transformed).decode('utf-8')

# Reverse each word (split on spaces) to recover original text
original = ' '.join(word[::-1] for word in decoded.split(' '))

# Print the representation of the reconstructed text
print(repr(original))
```

