The number of finite nonempty sets \(B\) with maximum element \(a\) is \(2^{a-1}\) (any subset of \(\{1,\dots,a-1\}\) together with \(a\)).  
Thus

\[
\sum_{a\in A}2^{a-1}=2024.
\]

Write 2024 as a sum of distinct powers of 2:

\[
2024 = 1024 + 512 + 256 + 128 + 64 + 32 + 8
     = 2^{10}+2^{9}+2^{8}+2^{7}+2^{6}+2^{5}+2^{3}.
\]

Hence the corresponding elements of \(A\) are \(a = 11,10,9,8,7,6,4\).  
The sum of the elements of \(A\) is

\[
11+10+9+8+7+6+4 = 55.
\]

\[
\boxed{55}
\]

