\]

so \(110^{4}+1\) is divisible by \(289=17^{2}\).

No smaller prime than \(17\) works (primes \(2,3,5,7,11,13\) fail the condition \(p\equiv1\pmod8\)), and among the four lifts for \(p=17\), \(110\) is the least.

